Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.40,H_fil,,0,0,0,,"Walang akong takot. May altar na ako. NEMESIS ako ng masamang multo."
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:46.40,C_fil,,0,0,0,,Panuorin LAHAT — LIBRE ▶ YT688.app
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.04,0:00:02.81,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ano'ng ikakatakot ko?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.85,0:00:03.81,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Naitatag ko na ang altar ko.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.85,0:00:05.81,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ako ang kalaban ng masasamang multo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.85,0:00:06.88,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ikaw, sino ka?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.92,0:00:09.00,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapal-palang pumasok ka nang ganyan?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.04,0:00:14.14,S_fil,,0,0,0,,'Yan ang ghost immortal na sariwang recruit ng altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:15.14,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pumasa na siya sa assessment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:16.17,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Batang 'to,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:18.17,S_fil,,0,0,0,,tumingin kang mabuti bago magsalita.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.21,0:00:19.17,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kaya pala nanghihina ako
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.21,0:00:21.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,ay dahil sa kanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:23.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Nakatira siya sa katawan mo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.63,0:00:24.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Hindi mo siya namalayan
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.63,0:00:26.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,o ipinadala siya sa likod para mag-practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.63,0:00:27.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,kaya masama pakiramdam mo hanggang ngayon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:28.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Bakit 'di mo sinabi kanina pa?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.63,0:00:29.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kayo ang nag-recruit sa kanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.63,0:00:30.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pagkatapos i-vet siya,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.63,0:00:31.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,padalhin mo na siya sa likod —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.63,0:00:32.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Ayan, tapos na, 'di ba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.63,0:00:33.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kalokohan 'yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,May rules ang altar.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.63,0:00:36.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kapag may pumasok na spirit,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.63,0:00:37.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,dapat alam ng medium.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.63,0:00:38.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,at dapat tanungin nang malinaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.63,0:00:39.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Kung hindi, kahit pusa o aso
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.63,0:00:41.59,S_fil,,0,0,0,,puwede nang mag-practice dito?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.63,0:00:44.42,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Pwedeng malaman ang pangalan mo, ghost immortal?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.42,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Saan ka nagmula?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.46,0:00:46.40,S_fil,,0,0,0,,Anong kapangyarihan ang meron ka?
